>
  <header class="container page-title">
    <p class="eyebrow">About</p>
    <h1>Hi, I'm Moisés</h1>
  </header>

  <section class="container card prose reveal">
    <p>
      I'm an agronomist by training and have spent most of my career turning satellite imagery and territorial data into
      decision tools. I live in Florianópolis, Brazil.
    </p>
    <p>
      I started in 2008 in a geoprocessing lab, worked at INPE and Funcate, and in 2013 co-founded Agrosatélite, where I was CTO
      for over ten years. There I helped create the MapBiomas croplands and planted forests methodologies and coordinated the data
      infrastructure of the LULUCF inventory in Brazil's Fourth National Communication to the UNFCCC. The company was acquired by
      Serasa Experian in 2023, where I led product development until 2025.
    </p>
    <p>
      Today I consult through <a href="https://coordenadageo.com.br" rel="noreferrer">Coordenada Geo</a>, and use this space for
      what doesn't fit in a résumé: readings, ideas and experiments in philosophy, history, technology and other curiosities.
    </p>
    <p>
      The full history is on <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/moisessalgado/" rel="noreferrer">LinkedIn</a>. To get in touch:
      <a href="mailto:contato@moisessalgado.com.br">contato@moisessalgado.com.br</a>.
    </p>
  </section>
</Base>
